     · the WRONG RUNG — every arm bound `--glass-blur-wash` = `blur(1px)`, a radius
       `glass.css` itself calls sub-perceptual, on a CONTENT panel whose tier is
       `--glass-blur-quiet` = `blur(7px)`;
